      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Medina%2C_Washington",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Medina receives slightly less rainfall than westside Seattle because the Olympic Mountains create a rain shadow over the eastside.",
